WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.720
Barium chloride is poisonous.

2
00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:04.680
Swallowing it is dangerous.

3
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:10.180
Yet before some X-ray scans, patients
drink a barium mixture, on purpose.

4
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:11.220
Same element.

5
00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:15.300
One compound is a poison, the
other goes into a medical drink.

6
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.940
So why is a barium drink safe?

7
00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:22.240
In this mission, you'll watch a solid
in water reach a two-way balance,

8
00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:25.400
with ions leaving the
crystal and rejoining it.

9
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.680
Then you'll meet one
constant for that balance,

10
00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:31.920
and predict when a solid will
form as two solutions mix.

11
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:38.030
Your mission: explain why a barium drink can be
safe when other barium compounds are poisonous.